flowchart TD
  A[Queued job] --> B[Lease + attempt record]
  B --> C[Fetch immutable assets]
  C --> D[Validate, scan, safely extract]
  D --> E[Classify / exclude unsafe or irrelevant files]
  E --> F[Parse, chunk, metadata]
  F --> G[Retrieve evidence per rubric criterion]
  G --> H[LLM emits schema-validated criterion scores]
  H --> I{Confidence / policy checks}
  I -->|pass| J[Deterministic weighted aggregate]
  I -->|uncertain| K[REVIEW_REQUIRED]
  J --> L[Persist immutable result + provenance]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Notify student and reviewer]
  D -->|permanent invalid input| X[FAILED terminal]
  H -->|transient provider error| R[Retry with backoff]
  R --> B
